  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will form a Cooperation between KEMI, Sweden and The      Ministry of Chemicals and Ferilisers, Government of India and a local NGO Toxics Link. The areas of collaboration will be in the area of    chemical management, establishment of appropriate legislation,        capacity building and strengthening of enforcement systems.</narrative>
